&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div itemprop="articleBody" class="msgBody"&gt;

&lt;pre&gt;I strongly support shipping this. Thanks, Michael, for working on this and
going through the I2S process.&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre&gt;

