&lt;div class="msgHead"&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;
&lt;span class="subject"&gt;&lt;a href="/search?l=blink-dev@chromium.org&amp;q=subject:%22Re%5C%3A+%5C%5Bblink%5C-dev%5C%5D+Intent+to+Ship%5C%3A+Window+shape+API%22&amp;o=newest" rel="nofollow"&gt;&lt;span itemprop="name"&gt;Re: [blink-dev] Intent to Ship: Window shape API&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p class="darkgray font13"&gt;
&lt;span class="sender pipe"&gt;&lt;a href="/search?l=blink-dev@chromium.org&amp;q=from:%22%27Edman+Anjos%27+via+blink%5C-dev%22" rel="nofollow"&gt;&lt;span itemprop="author" itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/Person"&gt;&lt;span itemprop="name"&gt;'Edman Anjos' via blink-dev&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="date"&gt;&lt;a href="/search?l=blink-dev@chromium.org&amp;q=date:20260824" rel="nofollow"&gt;Mon, 24 Aug 2026 10:55:42 -0700&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div itemprop="articleBody" class="msgBody"&gt;

&lt;pre&gt;Thank you for the approvals!

We have updated the explainer and spec to expose the API as 
`window.setShape`. The change has also been made to the implementation in 
chromium.&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre&gt;

On Friday, July 31, 2026 at 2:12:51 AM UTC+2 Alex Russell wrote:

&gt; Superfluous LGTM4; thanks for the flexibility, Edman.
&gt;
&gt; Best,
&gt;
&gt; Alex
&gt;
&gt; On Thursday, July 30, 2026 at 4:51:24 PM UTC-7 Chris Harrelson wrote:
&gt;
&gt;&gt; LGTM3
&gt;&gt;
&gt;&gt; On Thu, Jul 30, 2026, 11:31 AM Mike Taylor &lt;&lt;a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="096460626c272727496a617b6664607c6427667b6e"&gt;[email&#160;protected]&lt;/a&gt;&gt; wrote:
&gt;&gt;
&gt; LGTM2
&gt;&gt;&gt; On 7/29/26 4:27 p.m., Rick Byers wrote:
&gt;&gt;&gt;
&gt;&gt; We discussed this in API owners today and Alex made a compelling argument 
&gt;&gt;&gt; for why there is no need to namespace-scope IWA APIs (they're already 
&gt;&gt;&gt; heavily scoped by the fact they exist only in the niche IWA operating 
&gt;&gt;&gt; environment). Alex, Reilly, Edman and I then met to discuss the tradeoffs 
&gt;&gt;&gt; further and agreed that we'd remove the namespace scoping (eg. 
&gt;&gt;&gt; window.setShape).  
&gt;&gt;&gt;
&gt;&gt;&gt; Given this significant change, I suggest we reset the lgtm counter. I'm 
&gt;&gt;&gt; LGTM1 with this new plan (once the spec is updated to reflect it).
&gt;&gt;&gt;
&gt;&gt;&gt; Thanks,
&gt;&gt;&gt;    Rick
&gt;&gt;&gt;
&gt;&gt;&gt;
