&gt;&gt;&gt; On Friday, July 24, 2026 at 3:48:40 AM UTC-7 &lt;a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="81f2e0eae9afafafc1e2e9f3eeece8f4ecafeef3e6"&gt;[email&#160;protected]&lt;/a&gt; wrote:
