&lt;pre&gt;With the aside that this isn't what I hope TC39 is spending a lot of time 
on (where are Decorators?), LGTM2.&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre&gt;

On Monday, August 24, 2026 at 6:59:52 AM UTC-7 Mike Taylor wrote:

&gt; LGTM1
&gt; On 8/24/26 9:40 a.m., Chromestatus wrote:
&gt;
&gt; *Contact emails*
&gt; &lt;a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="ec8285878380c2c2c2ac8f849e8381859981c2839e8b"&gt;[email&#160;protected]&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="a7c8cb898989e7c0c8c8c0cbc289c4c8ca"&gt;[email&#160;protected]&lt;/a&gt;
