&lt;pre&gt;I experimented on both 1% and 10% of stable.

Finch gathered the data (go/incognitostaticstoragequota:metrics) and it 
looks like there are no significant movements at any stability metric. 
Moving to 100% tomorrow unless you have any concerns.
