&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; On Thursday, June 18, 2026 at 6:27:57 AM UTC-7 Chromestatus wrote:
&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;
&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; *Contact emails*
&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; &lt;a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="0d60646e656c61652323234d6a62626a6168236e6260"&gt;[email&#160;protected]&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="ff9dd1d1d1bf98909098939ad19c9092"&gt;[email&#160;protected]&lt;/a&gt;
&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;
&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; *Explainer*
&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; &lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://github.com/explainers-by-googlers/static-storage-quota"&gt;https://github.com/explainers-by-googlers/static-storage-quota&lt;/a&gt;
