&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; Blink&gt;Storage&gt;Quota 
&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://issues.chromium.org/issues?q=customfield1222907:%22Blink%3EStorage%3EQuota%22"&gt;https://issues.chromium.org/issues?q=customfield1222907:%22Blink%3EStorage%3EQuota%22&lt;/a&gt;&gt;
