&lt;div itemprop="articleBody" class="msgBody"&gt;

&lt;pre&gt;Excellent, thanks Ravjit! If you say the tests are passing, that's good
enough for me (we can always backtrack if we find some surprise / bug we
can't quickly fix). So LGTM1 to ship once the test names are corrected and
assuming you'll check the wpt.fyi results after it lands and fix any issues
before it reaches stable.&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre&gt;

It's your call if you want to land a change to status=experimental first.
It doesn't hurt, and it might be useful if you don't immediately get 3
LGTMs.

Rick

