&lt;div class="msgHead"&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;
&lt;span class="subject"&gt;&lt;a href="/search?l=blink-dev@chromium.org&amp;q=subject:%22%5C%5Bblink%5C-dev%5C%5D+Intent+to+Prototype%5C%3A+Scroll+snap+for+single%5C-axis+scroll+containers%22&amp;o=newest" rel="nofollow"&gt;&lt;span itemprop="name"&gt;[blink-dev] Intent to Prototype: Scroll snap for single-axis scroll containers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p class="darkgray font13"&gt;
&lt;span class="sender pipe"&gt;&lt;a href="/search?l=blink-dev@chromium.org&amp;q=from:%22Chromestatus%22" rel="nofollow"&gt;&lt;span itemprop="author" itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/Person"&gt;&lt;span itemprop="name"&gt;Chromestatus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="date"&gt;&lt;a href="/search?l=blink-dev@chromium.org&amp;q=date:20260817" rel="nofollow"&gt;Mon, 17 Aug 2026 14:06:10 -0700&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div itemprop="articleBody" class="msgBody"&gt;

&lt;pre&gt;Contact emails
&lt;a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="48242b2c29666666082f27272f242d662b2725"&gt;[email&#160;protected]&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre&gt;

Explainer
&lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://github.com/explainers-by-googlers/single-axis-scroll-snap"&gt;https://github.com/explainers-by-googlers/single-axis-scroll-snap&lt;/a&gt;


Specification
No information provided


Summary
Supports per-axis scroll snap area propagation and alignment for single-axis 
scroll containers (eg, containers with overflow: auto clip;). When a snap area 
specifies snap alignments on both axes, a single-axis scroll container consumes 
only its scrollable axis and propagates the unconsumed axis up to find the 
nearest ancestor scroller capable of scrolling in that direction.


Blink component
Blink&gt;Scroll


Web Feature ID
scroll-snap


Motivation
This is part of the single-axis scroll container feature 
(&lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://github.com/explainers-by-googlers/single-axis-scroll-containers"&gt;https://github.com/explainers-by-googlers/single-axis-scroll-containers&lt;/a&gt;) to 
align the scroll snap behavior with the sticky header in a single-axis scroll 
container.


Initial public proposal
&lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/14018"&gt;https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/14018&lt;/a&gt;


Goals for experimentation
None


Requires code in //chrome?
False


Tracking bug
&lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://b.corp.google.com/issues/473576119"&gt;https://b.corp.google.com/issues/473576119&lt;/a&gt;


Estimated milestones

No milestones specified



