&lt;pre&gt;&gt; Does M154 also come with a deprecation warning or is this just going be a 
silent stub?&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre&gt;

There will be a DevTools warning on Fenced Frame removal added to M154. It 
will show whenever a Fenced Frame is created.

