&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; Does this intent deprecate or change behavior of existing APIs, such
&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; that it has potentially high risk for Android WebView-based 
&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; applications?
